<title>USA: AMEX to list Nationwide Financial options.</title>
<headline>AMEX to list Nationwide Financial options.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Stock Exchange (AMEX) said it will list options on Nationwide Financial Services Inc shares on June 13.</p>
<p>The options will have initial strike prices of 25, 30 and 35, with expirations in July, August, October and January, the exchange said. Position limits are 7,500 contracts.</p>
<p>Kalb Voohis &amp; Co/Cranmer &amp; Cranmer Inc will be the specialist on the AMEX floor.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Derivatives Desk ((312-408-8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
